      <title>WordPress Breeze Cache Plugin — Unauthenticated Arbitrary File Upload (CVE-2026-3844)</title>
      <link>http://192.168.0.124:1313/pocs/web/2026-07-05_cve-2026-3844-wordpress-breeze-cache-file-upload/</link>
